  "heading": "\\axiom.of.empty.set",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{Axiom of Empty Set}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\axiom.of.empty.set]\nAxiom:\nthen:\n. exists: X is \\set\n  suchThat:\n  . forAll: Z is \\set\n    then:\n    . not: Z \"in\"? X\nDocumented:\n. called: \"Axiom of Empty Set\"\n. description: \"There is a set having no members: for every set $Z$, $Z \\notin\n                X$. Extensionality makes this set unique, so any construction\n                with no members denotes the same empty set.\"\nId: \"f2180719-568d-4084-982b-a71c5f195bf6\"",
